인=스킬 정본 일치, 게이트 OK·governance 25/25, 코어 해시 마커·snapshot·css-integrity·source manifest 동기화\n\n문서\n- docs/archive/로 v4~v5.0 시점 고정 리뷰/분석/계획 6종 이관(+색인)\n- Guide.md v5.2.x 재작성, AGENTS.md 머신 절대경로→저장소 상대경로 정정\n- README.md: 라이브 캐노니컬 갤러리(index+13모드)·final 템플릿 미리보기·전문가 리뷰·v5.2.3 반영\n\n검증기/기타\n- validate_output.py: sources/profile.json 필수화 + --profile 일치 검사 강화\n- final_20260604 아이콘-텍스트 배치 통일, windows-audio PCM reference 산출물 추가\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d91050f7f50a5c480cb2c0de0f5f29c6d66bb0f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coreline-ai/skills-html-showcase/git/trees/d91050f7f50a5c480cb2c0de0f5f29c6d66bb0f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coreline-ai/skills-html-showcase/git/commits/d0de48f6c6752c579e709336cc8172dd28fad343","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coreline-ai/skills-html-showcase/commits/d0de48f6c6752c579e709336cc8172dd28fad343","html_url":"https://github.com/coreline-ai/skills-html-showcase/commit/d0de48f6c6752c579e709336cc8172dd28fad343","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/coreline-ai/skills-html-showcase/commits/d0de48f6c6752c579e709336cc8172dd28fad343/comments","author":{"login":"coreline-ai","id":253600811,"node_id":"U_kgDODx2kKw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/253600811?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coreline-ai","html_url":"https://github.com/coreline-ai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coreline-ai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coreline-ai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coreline-ai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coreline-ai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coreline-ai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coreline-ai/orgs","repos_url":"ht